cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "UR3 Voice Control with ROS 2 and ROSA"
abstract: >-
  Voice control of a Universal Robots UR3 collaborative manipulator in Italian.
  Speech is transcribed with OpenAI Whisper and interpreted by the NASA JPL ROSA
  agent with GPT-4o, which can only call four tools (absolute move, relative move,
  home, end session) that publish JSON commands on a ROS 2 topic. A ROS 2 Humble
  and MoveIt 2 pipeline checks straight-line reachability before executing each
  motion, on a Gazebo digital twin or on the real robot. Developed as a Bachelor's
  thesis at the University of Brescia.
authors:
